Derived material:
  * All prompt text in crates/proxy/src/approaches and crates/proxy/src/plugins
    is copied verbatim from the corresponding optillm/*.py and
    optillm/plugins/*.py modules.
  * The approach, plugin and server logic in crates/proxy is a port of
    optillm/server.py, optillm/batching.py, optillm/conversation_logger.py and
    the approach / plugin modules.

A copy of the Apache License, Version 2.0 is in crates/proxy/UPSTREAM_LICENSE.
crates/proxy is distributed under the same license.

The CPython-compatible helpers in crates/proxy/src/py reproduce the
behaviour of CPython's `random` (Mersenne Twister), `difflib` and `json`
modules (Python Software Foundation License) so that results match the
upstream Python implementation.
